sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant API
    participant Stripe
    participant Webhook
    participant DB
    participant Email

    User->>Frontend: Select Premium Plan
    Frontend->>API: Request checkout (Email + Wallet)
    API->>Stripe: Create checkout session
    Stripe-->>API: Checkout session URL
    API-->>Frontend: Redirect URL
    Frontend->>User: Redirect to Stripe checkout
    User->>Stripe: Complete payment
    Stripe->>User: Redirect to success page
    Stripe->>Webhook: checkout.session.completed event
    Webhook->>DB: Update user to Premium
    Webhook->>DB: Generate Premium API key
    Webhook->>Email: Send Premium confirmation
    Email-->>User: Premium API Key
